id=qp_refresh120
name=Quest Pro Display Overclock
version=v2.1
versionCode=6
author=CreoleVR
description=unlocks 100/110/120 hz on the meta quest pro (seacliff). live-patches the dsi refresh-rate table and re-inits the display composers so the rates appear; head tracking and passthrough are preserved. applied in memory at boot - no system partition touched - so disabling reverts the headset.
